sequenceDiagram
    actor User as User / Creator
    participant MM as MetaMask / Script
    participant Anvil as Anvil (31337)
    participant BETT as BettingToken
    participant PM as PredictionMarket
    participant CL as Chainlink Aggregator

    Note over User,CL: Phase 0 — Create Market (100 BETT fee)
    User->>MM: approve(PM, 100)
    MM->>BETT: allowance set
    User->>MM: createMarket(aggregator, strike, duration)
    MM->>PM: createMarket()
    PM->>BETT: transferFrom(user, PM, 100)
    PM->>PM: markets[newId] stored

    Note over User,CL: Phase 1 — Acquire tokens
    User->>MM: mint()
    MM->>Anvil: tx
    Anvil->>BETT: _mint(user, 1000 BETT)

    Note over User,CL: Phase 2 — Place bet
    User->>MM: approve(PM, amount)
    MM->>BETT: allowance set
    User->>MM: placeBet(marketId, isYes, amount)
    MM->>PM: placeBet()
    PM->>BETT: transferFrom(user, PM, amount)
    PM->>PM: update total pools & user bets

    Note over User,CL: Phase 3 — Resolve (after endTime)
    Note over User,PM: Triggered by User (UI) OR watch-resolve.sh
    User->>MM: resolveMarket(marketId)
    MM->>PM: resolveMarket()
    PM->>CL: latestRoundData()
    CL-->>PM: price, roundId, timestamps
    PM->>PM: yesWins = price > strikePrice

    Note over User,CL: Phase 4 — Claim
    User->>MM: claimWinnings(marketId)
    MM->>PM: claimWinnings()
    PM->>BETT: transfer(user, payout)
